  {
    "id": 2022010110170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "この前のソロ曲も、一緒に頑張っていたんだなって\r\nだから成功したんだって……思ったんです──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201011/2022010110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010110180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "で、でも、やっぱりプロデューサーさんの方が\r\nいっぱいお仕事してると思うんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201011/2022010110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010110190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、それでも、頑張ることでプロデューサーさんの……\r\n……たくさんの人へのお返しになるなら──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201011/2022010110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022010110200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたし……\r\nプロデューサーさんと一緒に頑張りたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201011/2022010110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、もちろん俺も小糸と頑張りたいと\r\n思ってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
